# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4, 7 and 8: the arm built is fixed; its dynamic is `$shown`, so a write of the arm's hold or of the panel's `$resets` changes the label in that tick; the label takes the next number after the places the arm built (ruling TC): 2 after the loud arm's button, 1 after the soft arm, which builds none.
test a_loud_arm

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="reset")
    1: Ui.Button(label="hey!")
    2: Ui.Label(text="hey 0 0")

tick 1
  in:
    1: click
  changed:
    2: Ui.Label(text="hey 1 0")

tick 2
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    2: Ui.Label(text="hey 1 1")

test a_soft_arm

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="reset")
    1: Ui.Label(text="soft 0")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    1: Ui.Label(text="soft 1")
